        "But a loss is a loss. I admit it.\r",
        "As proof that you defeated me, I’ll give\n",
        "you a rare Fighting-type Pokémon.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0121_D38R0104_00002",
      "en_US": [
